### Equation for WCD Calculation:
The WCD is calculated as:
\[
WCD = (\text{hop\_count} \times (\text{propagation\_delay} + \text{switching\_delay} + \text{time\_sync\_error})) + \left(\frac{\text{max\_frame\_size}}{\text{bandwidth\_link}} \times 8\right) + (\text{cycle\_duration} \times (\text{hop\_count} - 1))
\]

This equation accounts for the propagation, switching, and synchronization delays, transmission time, and the CQF cycle delay.

